OL,3,GNEWSA'Show-off' driver jailed for crash
OL,4,Awhich killed one and injured two       
OL,6,FA driver has been jailed for nine years
OL,7,Fafter "showing off" in his             
OL,8,Fhigh-performance Mercedes, leading to a
OL,9,Fcrash which killed one passenger and   
OL,10,Fleft two others with life-threatening  
OL,11,Finjuries when it exploded on a motorway
OL,12,Fnear Heathrow airport.                 
OL,14,FAadil Sabir, 31, from Cardiff, "shot   
OL,15,Foff like a rocket" after a road block  
OL,16,Fwas lifted by traffic police following 
OL,17,Fan earlier collision on the M4, on 29  
OL,18,FOctober 2023.                          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
