OL,3,GNEWSA'Show-off' driver jailed for crash
OL,4,Awhich killed one and injured two       
OL,6,FSabir reached speeds of some 90mph     
OL,7,Fbefore the vehicle aquaplaned, collided
OL,8,Fwith a barrier and exploded, the Old   
OL,9,FBailey heard.                          
OL,11,FRear passenger William Bailey, 28, was 
OL,12,Ftrapped inside and killed "by the      
OL,13,Fdangerous driving of a show-off," said 
OL,14,FJudge Philip Katz. "His death was      
OL,15,Fentirely avoidable."                   
